        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "The secret to good toltott paprika is using raw rice in the filling. It absorbs the cooking juices and expands inside the pepper, binding everything together. Pre-cooked rice will make the filling dry and loose." }]
